			"notes": "First release of the Minecraft 26.3 port of [Villager Reroll by Joplayz](https://github.com/Joplayz/villager-reroll-26.1.2).\n\n## Install\n\nDrop `villager-reroll-1.0.0+26.3.jar` into your `mods` folder together with:\n\n- Fabric Loader 0.19.5 or newer\n- Fabric API 0.162.0+26.3\n- YetAnotherConfigLib 3.9.7+26.3-fabric\n- Mod Menu 21.0.0\n\nClient-side only. The server doesn't need it.\n\n## Changes from the original\n\n- Updated to Minecraft 26.3.\n- Lecterns are found in the hotbar, offhand or inventory, not just the hotbar.\n- If the broken lectern lands out of reach, the mod walks over (sneaking), picks it up and walks back.\n- Select a specific villager with `/reroll villager`. It gets an outline only you can see.\n- `/reroll` commands for everything, handled on your client and never sent to the server.\n- HUD scale, position and a compact one-line mode.\n- Fixed: the set-position key saved the floor block instead of the space above it.\n- Fixed: trade offers from the previous attempt could be read again on the next one.\n- Stops before your axe breaks.\n\nFull command list and defaults are in the [README](https://github.com/1REDfriend/villager-reroll-26.3#readme)."
		}
